must-keep or relied-on claim narrowed; the PRODIGY, EURISKO, Harness
Evolution, faithfulness and closing falsification passages are untouched.

1. Before: "That sequence establishes three things. First, the system adapted
   across tasks …" After: "This constructed illustration shows three
   things. First, a system can adapt across tasks …", plus "In the
   illustration, the trial beat adding the line as proposed under every
   compatible measure. Choosing the trial over leaving the file alone was a
   bounded decision under reversibility, not a shown improvement." Evidence
